,"status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m003-0149","start":149,"end":150,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m003-0163","start":163,"end":164,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m003-0176","start":176,"end":177,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m003-0231","start":231,"end":232,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m003-0282","start":282,"end":283,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m003-0318","start":318,"end":321,"surface":"白馬將","kind":"person","person_id":"39q_zuo_xkc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m003-0326","start":326,"end":328,"surface":"李廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m003-0338","start":338,"end":341,"surface":"白馬將","kind":"person","person_id":"39q_zuo_xkc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m003-0405","start":405,"end":407,"surface":"李廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m003-0417","start":417,"end":418,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","book_id":"b-shiji-109","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p004","text":"居久之，孝景崩，武帝立，左右以爲廣名將也，於是廣以上郡太守爲未央衞尉，而程不識亦爲長樂衞尉。程不識故與李廣俱以邊太守將軍屯。及出擊胡，而廣行無部伍行陳，就善水草屯，舍止，人人自便，不擊刀鬬以自衞，莫府省約文書籍事，然亦遠斥候，未嘗遇害。程不識正部曲行伍營陳，擊刀鬬，士吏治軍簿至明，軍不得休息，然亦未嘗遇害。不識曰：「李廣軍極簡易，然虜卒犯之，無以禁也；而其士卒亦佚樂，咸樂爲之死。我軍雖煩擾，然虜亦不得犯我。」是時漢邊郡李廣、程不識皆爲名將，然匈奴畏李廣之略，士卒亦多樂從李廣而苦程不識。程不識孝景時以數直諫爲太中大夫。爲人廉，謹於文法。","annotation_status":